#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "A long error or refusal reason the agent reads is shortened at a word boundary, so it never ends in half a file path."
msgstr "Alasan kesalahan atau penolakan yang panjang yang dibaca agen dipotong di batas kata, sehingga tidak pernah berakhir di tengah jalur file."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "A material swap on copies the agent placed is either applied everywhere it shows or refused by name; it no longer silently fails on collection instances. In this version, swaps on parts with Geometry Nodes, instancing, drivers, curves or text are refused."
msgstr "Penggantian bahan pada salinan yang ditempatkan agen diterapkan di mana pun salinan itu tampil atau ditolak dengan menyebut namanya; tidak lagi gagal diam-diam pada instance koleksi. Di versi ini, penggantian pada bagian dengan Geometry Nodes, pembuatan instance, driver, kurva, atau teks ditolak."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "A meter at the top of the chat shows its tokens, the share that was cached, and an estimated cost or your plan's limit use."
msgstr "Meteran di bagian atas obrolan menampilkan token-nya, porsi yang di-cache, serta perkiraan biaya atau pemakaian batas paket Anda."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "A new chat shows its usage meter as soon as a connection is chosen, including your plan's usage window."
msgstr "Obrolan baru menampilkan meteran penggunaannya begitu koneksi dipilih, termasuk periode penggunaan paket Anda."

