#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.2 connects Claude Code and Codex to Angelo over MCP, and renders on your GPU by default."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.2 menghubungkan Claude Code dan Codex ke Angelo melalui MCP, dan merender dengan GPU Anda secara default."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.3 improves how the agent works in Blender, makes saving safer, and carries fixes from upstream Blender."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.3 meningkatkan cara agen bekerja di Blender, membuat penyimpanan lebih aman, serta membawa perbaikan dari proyek Blender resmi."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.4 keeps Blender's menus in Director, keeps an animation render's finished frames through a crash, shows what each chat uses, and renders on your GPU on every path."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.4 mempertahankan menu Blender di Sutradara, menyimpan bingkai render animasi yang sudah selesai saat crash, menampilkan penggunaan tiap obrolan, dan merender di GPU Anda lewat jalur mana pun."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.5 puts Media Studio and Generation Flows one click away, lets you drag Media Studio's work into Blender's editors, opens your .blend files to external AI apps without Angelo's window on macOS and Linux, and stops trusting the compromised emSign certificates."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.5 membuat Media Studio dan Alur Pembuatan hanya berjarak satu klik, memungkinkan Anda menyeret hasil kerja Media Studio ke editor Blender, membuka file .blend Anda bagi aplikasi AI eksternal tanpa jendela Angelo di macOS dan Linux, dan tidak lagi memercayai sertifikat emSign yang telah bocor."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.6 brings parallel edit: on a capable machine, the agent can split a scene into parts that worker agents build at the same time, then merge them into your scene. It also poses hands, exports scenes for the web and welds imported glTF models with shape keys so they show no seams."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.6 menghadirkan edit paralel: di komputer yang mampu, agen dapat membagi adegan menjadi bagian-bagian yang dibangun agen pekerja secara bersamaan, lalu menggabungkannya ke adegan Anda. Angelo juga membuat pose tangan, mengekspor adegan untuk web dan menyatukan jahitan model glTF impor yang memiliki kunci bentuk agar tidak terlihat."

#. src: bpy.types.ANGELO_MT_team_account
msgid "Angelo Account"
msgstr "Akun Angelo"

